| `ClientObject.cpp:296-300` | `if (Game::getSinglePlayer() \|\| !Game::getScene()) { setNetworkId(getNextFakeNetworkId()); … }` | **true** (single-player clause) at ctor time | **false** during in-scene server create (`getScene()` non-null, single-player false) | (a) transient fake id assigned then overwritten by snapshot id at `WorldSnapshot.cpp:287`; (b) id stays invalid until `setNetworkId` at `GroundScene.cpp:2597` |
