| `ClientObject.h:82` | Default notification = `ClientWorld::getTangibleNotification()` | same for `BuildingObject`/`TangibleObject` chain | same | POB buildings target `ms_tangibleSphereTree` unless template class overrides (e.g. `StaticObject.cpp:24` → `TangibleNotTargetableNotification`) |

